  "term": "cannabis",
  "definition": "Cannabis is a psychoactive substance whose use is described here as an environmental risk factor for psychotic disorders, especially in early psychosis. In this context, it is associated with stronger dissociative experiences and disturbances in self-experience, particularly with frequent use of high-potency THC products.",
